{"ticker":"BKR","updated":"2026-11-13T22:41:59Z","profile":{"longName":"Baker Hughes Company","shortName":"Baker Hughes Company","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Equipment & Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.bakerhughes.com","fullTimeEmployees":65600,"marketCap":49097797632,"trailingPE":16.989689,"forwardPE":17.513655,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.7083437,"pegRatio":1.36,"targetMeanPrice":70.0,"targetHighPrice":85.0,"targetLowPrice":51.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.145,"earningsGrowth":-0.328,"grossMargins":0.23698999,"operatingMargins":0.12196,"profitMargins":0.100839995,"totalRevenue":28739999744,"beta":1.058,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":70.41,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":44.26,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.88},"summary":"Baker Hughes Company provides a portfolio of technologies and services to energy and industrial value chain. Its Oilfield Services & Equipment segment designs and manufactures exploration, appraisal, development, production, rejuvenation, and decommissioning products and related services for onshore and offshore oilfield operations. This segment also provides drilling services, drill bits, and drilling and completions fluids; completions, intervention, measurements, pressure pumping, and wireline services; artificial lift systems, and oilfield and industrial chemicals; subsea projects and services, flexible pipe systems, and surface pressure control systems; and integrated well services and solutions. It serves oil and natural gas companies; the United States and international independent oil and natural gas companies; national or state-owned oil companies; engineering, procurement, and construction contractors; geothermal companies; and other oilfield service companies. The company's Industrial & Energy Technology segment offers gas technology equipment, such as drivers, driven equipment, and turnkey solutions for the mechanical and electric-drive, compression, and power-generation applications; aftermarket support and uptime gas technology services; non-destructive testing technologies, software, and services; pre-commissioning and maintenance services; flow control and safet","summary_zh":"貝克休斯公司為能源和工業價值鏈提供一系列技術和服務。其油田服務和設備部門為陸上和海上油田作業設計和製造勘探、評估、開發、生產、復興和退役產品以及相關服務。該部門還提供鑽井服務、鑽頭以及鑽井和完井液；完井、幹預、測量、壓力泵送和有線服務；人工舉升系統、油田和工業化學品；海底項目和服務、柔性管道系統和表面壓力控制系統；以及綜合油井服務和解決方案。它為石油和天然氣公司提供服務；美國和國際獨立石油和天然氣公司；國家或國有石油公司；工程、採購和施工承包商；地熱公司；和其他油田服務公司。該公司的工業與能源技術部門提供氣體技術設備，例如驅動器、驅動設備以及機械和電力驅動、壓縮和發電應用的交鑰匙解決方案；售後支援和正常運行天然氣技術服務；無損檢測技術、軟體和服務；預調試和維護服務；流量控制和安全","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"石油和天然氣設備與服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":46.49,"h":47.01,"l":46.24,"c":46.28,"v":5420000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":46.52,"h":47.38,"l":46.38,"c":47.23,"v":5092700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":47.15,"h":47.38,"l":46.09,"c":46.48,"v":4612900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":46.78,"h":47.35,"l":46.47,"c":47.28,"v":5242500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":47.22,"h":47.65,"l":46.4,"c":47.34,"v":15869100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":47.14,"h":47.85,"l":46.68,"c":47.67,"v":5157300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":47.83,"h":50.07,"l":47.81,"c":48.93,"v":9071400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":49.47,"h":50.14,"l":49.15,"c":49.87,"v":9055800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":49.68,"h":50.24,"l":49.5,"c":50.1,"v":6455300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":50.38,"h":50.93,"l":49.82,"c":50.52,"v":7751000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":50.36,"h":50.58,"l":49.79,"c":50.55,"v":6319200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":49.93,"h":50.26,"l":48.12,"c":48.72,"v":11666700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":48.51,"h":48.76,"l":48.22,"c":48.36,"v":6263700},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":48.09,"h":48.64,"l":47.85,"c":48.4,"v":6680100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":48.74,"h":49.01,"l":48.46,"c":48.5,"v":5414400},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":48.92,"h":49.58,"l":48.8,"c":49.08,"v":5371900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":49.1,"h":49.44,"l":48.23,"c":48.58,"v":4877700},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":48.75,"h":48.95,"l":47.42,"c":47.85,"v":6007100},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":48.0,"h":48.29,"l":47.09,"c":47.89,"v":5456600},{"t